# Hard PDE and Holder-space statements from Krylov

Ten statement-only formalizations selected from N. V. Krylov,
*Lectures on Elliptic and Parabolic Equations in Holder Spaces*.

Each problem lives in `Dataset/KrylovHolder/<declaration_name>.lean`,
accompanied by `<declaration_name>.md` (the natural-language statement from
the textbook) and `<declaration_name>.criteria.md` (a quality rubric for
judging formalizations of that statement).
Custom notions shared between problems are in `Dataset/KrylovHolder/Defs.lean`.
-/
